<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Booking Confirmed - {{eventTitle}}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; margin: 0; padding: 24px; }
    .card { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); }
    .header { background: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; padding: 28px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
    .header p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; opacity: 0.9; }
    .content { padding: 32px; }
    .info-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .info-table td { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; font-size: 15px; }
    .info-table td.label { color: #64748b; font-weight: 500; width: 35%; }
    .info-table td.value { color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600; }
    .qr-box { text-align: center; padding: 24px; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1; margin: 24px 0; }
    .qr-box img { width: 220px; height: 220px; display: block; margin: 0 auto 12px auto; }
    .qr-box p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 8px; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 32px; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Booking Confirmed</h1>
      <p>{{{eventTitle}}}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0;">Hi <strong>{{studentName}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>Your seat reservation for <strong>{{{eventTitle}}}</strong> is confirmed. A calendar invite (.ics) has been attached to this email with automated alerts.</p>
      
      <table class="info-table">
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Attendee</td>
          <td class="value">{{studentName}} (Roll: {{rollNumber}})</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Event Date</td>
          <td class="value">{{eventStart}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Venue</td>
          <td class="value">{{venueName}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{#if venueMapLink}}
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Directions</td>
          <td class="value"><a href="{{venueMapLink}}" target="_blank" style="color: #4f46e5;">View Venue Map & Directions</a></td>
        </tr>
        {{/if}}
      </table>

      <div class="qr-box">
        <img src="cid:ticket-qr" alt="Ticket QR Code" />
        <p><strong>Gate Pass Token:</strong> {{ticketToken}}</p>
        <p>Present this QR code at campus entry gates and volunteer scanning points.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{passportUrl}}" class="btn">Launch Event Passport</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      Eventora Smart Campus Event OS &bull; Campus Safety & Events Committee
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
